WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Home keeps your next step close.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Scroll through places to discover, Atlas towns and handy tools.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Pick a self-guided city visit.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Read about each stop and track your progress.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Get directions to the next place.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Start from your location, an address or the previous stop.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Pick Apple Maps or Google Maps, and your saved address goes with you.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.000
A saved draft is clearly marked as in progress.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Pick up where you left off, with your interests saved.
